   "text": "1Avoid if previous allergic reaction to iodine. 2History of angioedema, anaphylaxis or urticaria. 3Start by using twice a week and titrate up. Apply pea-sized amount to face, avoiding eyes and area around mouth and nose. 4Doxycycline may interfere with oral contraceptive, advise patient to use condoms as well. Avoid if pregnant or breastfeeding. If also taking iron supplements or antacids, take these at least 2 hours before or 4 hours after doxycycline dose.",
